cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "PyDiffChron"
type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Bastías-Silva"
    given-names: "Joaquín"
  - family-names: "Kent"
    given-names: "Adam J. R."
  - family-names: "Caricchi"
    given-names: "Luca"

repository-code: "https://github.com/JoaquinBastias/PyDiffChron"
license: "MIT"

abstract: >-
  PyDiffChron contains the numerical calculations and figure-generation
  workflows developed to investigate uncertainty and temperature-time
  non-uniqueness in diffusion chronometry using synthetic Ba and Sr
  concentration profiles in plagioclase.

keywords:
  - diffusion chronometry
  - geochronology
  - igneous petrology
  - plagioclase
  - barium
  - strontium
  - numerical modelling
